psmithnews@spod-central.org (Dylan O'Donnell) wrote:

>I'm not sure what you're asking for, in this case. If you want an
>official version of NetHack released by the DevTeam, then that's what
>we get, every year or two. If you want a non-official version of NetHack
>released by random people outside the DevTeam, that's what we get as well,
